## Annex C — Local addenda (summary of main differences)

Addendum A-DE (Hamburg-Waltershof, HAM-2): entry-tier annual leave 26 working days; probation 6 months with notice of 2 weeks; mileage ceiling as in Section 6. Addendum A-NL (Rotterdam-Maasvlakte, RTM-3): entry-tier annual leave 24 working days; a mobility budget of EUR 120 per month in place of the Polish transport reimbursement. Addendum A-SE (Gothenburg-Arendal, GOT-4): entry-tier annual leave 28 working days; 30 minutes' paid wellness time per shift. Addendum A-LT (Kłaipėda, KLJ-5): entry-tier annual leave 22 working days; statutory overtime rules of Lithuanian law apply in place of Section 2.4.

